{"version":1,"content":"<p>在威廉·吉布森1984年的經典科幻小説《神經漫遊者》中，信使把數據下載到大腦裏進行走私。如今，科學家提出了一種不那麼炫酷、卻現實得多的安全生物存儲方案：用遺傳物質代替神經元來保存信息。雖然「下載」速度慢得多，但這種長期保存海量資料的能力，或許值得等待。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588312.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:03:53.309333+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_hash":"ab41f68e8a49d8f8db07e356f928e6dcfd582e4c2b3d83a0bd03c4a78b302a4e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}